{"id":"vd-a1-the-wobbly-tooth","level":"a1","n":17,"title":{"en":"I'm Scared!","vi":"Em sợ lắm!"},"summary":"Chiếc răng cửa của Poppy lung lay; cô bé sợ, anh Theo hỏi han cảm xúc của em và kể về cô tiên răng.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-wobbly-tooth","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Wobbly Tooth","vi":"Chiếc răng lung lay"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"fried-eggs","x":800}]},"cast":{"poppy":{"name":{"en":"Poppy","vi":"Poppy"},"look":"girl","x":540,"style":{"hair":"pigtails","hairColor":"#E0B45C","top":"#F08FB0","topShade":"#DC7398","scale":0.94}},"theo":{"name":{"en":"Theo","vi":"Theo"},"look":"boy","x":1120,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#C98A3C","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA","collar":"#2F66AA"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"poppy","en":"Theo! My tooth is moving!","vi":"Anh Theo! Răng em đang động đậy!","ipa":["ˈθioʊ","maɪ","tuθ","ɪz","ˈmuvɪŋ"],"start":0.554,"end":3.544,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.995],[2,2.267],[3,2.729],[4,2.919]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Let me see. Oh, it's wobbly!","vi":"Để anh xem. Ồ, nó lung lay rồi!","ipa":["lɛt","mi","si","oʊ","ɪts","ˈwɑbəli"],"start":4.334,"end":7.654,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,4.334],[1,4.515],[2,4.714],[3,6.155],[4,6.723],[5,6.993]]},{"speaker":"poppy","en":"Is it going to hurt?","vi":"Có đau không anh?","ipa":["ɪz","ɪt","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","hɝt"],"start":8.444,"end":9.534,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,8.444],[1,8.576],[2,8.725],[3,9.065],[4,9.187]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"How do you feel, Poppy?","vi":"Em thấy thế nào, Poppy?","ipa":["haʊ","du","ju","fil","ˈpɑpi"],"start":10.324,"end":11.994,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,10.324],[1,10.497],[2,10.624],[3,10.809],[4,11.434]]},{"speaker":"poppy","en":"I'm scared.","vi":"Em sợ lắm.","ipa":["aɪm","skɛɹd"],"start":12.784,"end":13.634,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,12.784],[1,12.989]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Don't be scared. It doesn't hurt much.","vi":"Đừng sợ. Không đau lắm đâu.","ipa":["doʊnt